#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/TransactionManager.cpp:422
#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/TransactionManager.cpp:559
msgid ""
"The transaction resolved to no changes. The requested packages may already "
"be up to date or could not be matched against installed packages."
msgstr ""
"事务未产生任何更改。请求的软件包可能已是最新版本，或无法与已安装的软件包匹"
"配。"



