msgid "Failed to prepare transaction"
msgstr "准备事务失败"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:62
msgid ""
"The connection to the system D-Bus / dnf5daemon-server was lost (\"%1\"). "
"The service may have restarted.\n"
"\n"
"Please try the operation again. If the problem persists, restart the service "
"with:\n"
"  sudo systemctl restart dnf5daemon-server"
msgstr ""
"到系统 D-Bus / dnf5daemon-server 的连接已丢失（\"%1\"）。服务可能已重启。\n"
"\n"
"请重试该操作。如果问题持续存在，请使用以下命令重启服务：\n"
"  sudo systemctl restart dnf5daemon-server"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:362
msgid ""
"Did not receive a reply from dnf5daemon-server within the timeout period. "
"The service may be busy or unresponsive."
msgstr "在超时时间内未收到 dnf5daemon-server 的回复。该服务可能正忙或无响应。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:440
msgid ""
"Cannot connect to the D-Bus system bus.\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure the D-Bus system bus is running (dbus-broker / dbus-daemon)."
msgstr ""
"无法连接到 D-Bus 系统总线。\n"
"\n"
"请确保 D-Bus 系统总线正在运行（dbus-broker / dbus-daemon）。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:532
msgid ""
"Failed to open a session with dnf5daemon-server. The service may not be "
"running or may not be reachable via the system D-Bus. Try:\n"
"  sudo systemctl start dnf5daemon-server\n"
"  sudo systemctl enable dnf5daemon-server"
msgstr ""
"无法打开与 dnf5daemon-server 的会话。该服务可能未运行，或无法通过系统 D-Bus "
"访问。请尝试：\n"
"  sudo systemctl start dnf5daemon-server\n"
"  sudo systemctl enable dnf5daemon-server"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:900
msgid "Cannot load repositories."
msgstr "无法加载软件源。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:922
msgid "No active dnf5daemon session"
msgstr "没有活动的 dnf5daemon 会话"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1288
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server session was reset while resolving the transaction. The "
"prepared package changes were lost; please try again."
msgstr ""
"解析事务时 dnf5daemon-server 会话被重置。准备好的软件包更改已丢失，请重试。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1320
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server did not return a valid transaction summary. Please try "
"again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 未返回有效的事务摘要，请重试。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1329
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server returned a malformed transaction summary. Please try "
"again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 返回了格式错误的事务摘要，请重试。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1345
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server returned a transaction summary in an unexpected "
