msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 返回了格式意外的事务摘要，请重试。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1484
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server session was reset while running the transaction. The "
"resolved transaction was lost; please try again."
msgstr "运行事务时 dnf5daemon-server 会话被重置。已解析的事务已丢失，请重试。"



#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1533
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server did not confirm the transaction. Please try again."
msgstr "dnf5daemon-server 未确认该事务，请重试。"



